<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kimbyr to compulsorily acquire Underground.</title>
<headline>Kimbyr to compulsorily acquire Underground.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch's stand in the market on behalf of Kimbyr Investments expired on Friday and at that date Kimbyr, owned by Just Jeans, had acquired 95.33 percent of the issued capital, Kimbyr said on Monday.</p>
<p>In accordance with Listing Rule 4.8, Kimbyr will proceed to compulsory acquisition for the balance of shares it does not own.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
